{"id":"vod_bf_1314","vodId":"1314","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"俺物语","name_cn":"俺物语","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-2/b27fc82df0a8515632abfbdcfddbec7c.jpg"},"summary":"冈田猛男（江口拓也 配音）是集英高中一年级的学生，隶属于柔道部，他生得人高马大五大三粗，却因为善良率真的个性而深得同伴们的喜爱和信赖。砂川诚（岛崎信长 配音）是猛男青梅竹马的好友，外表英俊帅气的他很受女孩子的欢迎，从小到大，凡是猛男喜欢上的女孩，最后总会被阿诚吸引，久而久之，猛男竟然也习以为常。　　一次偶然中，猛男将一位名叫大和凛子（潘惠美 配音）的可爱女孩从电车痴汉手中救下，温柔可爱的凛子一下子击中了猛男的死穴，但猛男认为凛子喜欢的应该是阿诚那样的类型。让猛男没有想到的是，凛子喜欢的竟然正是强壮的猛男，阿诚得知了凛子的心意后开始积极地在两人之间牵线搭桥起来。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:20:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/anwuyu/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/anwuyu/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/anwuyu/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/anwuyu/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/anwuyu/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/anwuyu/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/anwuyu/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/anwuyu/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/anwuyu/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/anwuyu/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/anwuyu/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/anwuyu/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/anwuyu/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/anwuyu/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/anwuyu/第15集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.